   "find": "<figure class=\"lcw lcc\" data-mimic-hub=\"voices\"><div class=\"ttl\"><span>A drug, an illness, or a primary psychosis?</span><small>not to scale</small></div><ol class=\"wrows\"><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"medication-psychosis\" data-mrow-v=\"19da18d49526\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Medication-induced psychotic disorder</b><span class=\"win\">Begins with a new medication</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs sub\" style=\"--a:84%;--b:86%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"rk\"><span><i class=\"cs sub\"></i>Psychosis tied to a drug</span></p><p class=\"wl\">A new medication, eg, high-dose glucocorticoids</p><p class=\"wl\">Acute delusions or hallucinations</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Alert and oriented; timing ties it to the drug</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"medical-psychosis\" data-mrow-v=\"239d6d3731f9\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Psychotic disorder due to another medical condition</b><span class=\"win\">Begins and ends with the illness</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs ill\" style=\"--a:88%;--b:90%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"rk\"><span><i class=\"cs ill\"></i>Psychosis tied to an illness</span></p><p class=\"wl\">A disease known to cause psychosis (eg, brain tumor, thyroid storm)</p><p class=\"wl\">History, examination or labs show the disease</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Treating the disease often eases the psychosis</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"delirium\" data-mrow-v=\"44089d87b0dd\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Delirium</b><span class=\"win\">Hours to days; fluctuates</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs flux\" style=\"--a:90%;--b:92%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"rk\"><span><i class=\"cs flux\"></i>Fluctuating attention (delirium)</span></p><p class=\"wl\">A drug or illness as the cause</p><p class=\"wl\">Fluctuating attention and disorientation; any psychosis is secondary</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Attention fails over hours to days</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"substance-psychosis\" data-mrow-v=\"08e92d1a147c\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Substance-induced psychotic disorder</b><span class=\"win\">During or soon after use</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs sub\" style=\"--a:40%;--b:43%\"></i><i class=\"cs sub\" style=\"--a:54%;--b:57%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"rk\"><span><i class=\"cs sub\"></i>Psychosis tied to a drug</span></p><p class=\"wl\">Drug use shown by history, exam or labs</p><p class=\"wl\">Delusions or hallucinations</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Usually remits once use stops</p></div></li><li class=\"cr\" data-mrow=\"brief-psychotic\" data-mrow-v=\"34098c5fbd8d\"><div class=\"wh\"><b class=\"nm mask\">Brief psychotic disorder</b><span class=\"win\">1 day to under 1 month</span></div><div class=\"wb\"><div class=\"rail cstrip\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:0%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:20%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:38%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:62%\"></i><i class=\"tk\" style=\"--x:84%\"></i><i class=\"cs act\" style=\"--a:70%;--b:72%\"></i></div><div class=\"rax\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"a0\" style=\"--x:0%\">Child</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:20%\">Teens</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:38%\">20s</span><span class=\"\" style=\"--x:62%\">30s</span><span class=\"a1\" style=\"--x:84%\">40s+</span></div><p class=\"rk\"><span><i class=\"cs act\"></i>Active psychosis</span></p><p class=\"wl\">Sudden onset, often after a marked stressor</p><p class=\"wl\">1 or more: delusions, voices, disorganization</p><p class=\"wl dec\">Full return to baseline within a month</p></div></li></ol><p class=\"note\">Every look-alike: <a href=\"#voices\">Hears Voices or Holds Odd Beliefs</a></p></figure>\n",
